  With all we have crowdsourced, it looks like a decision to murder Charlie
  Kirk in Utah was made around July 18th.
  A military meeting with foreign leaders took place on July 20th on U.S soil.
  The plane flew into Provo direct from France on September 4th and stayed
  until just after Charlie was assassinated— flying out to Wilmington on that
  day.
  The plane returned home to Egypt the following day on September 11th.
